---
import { REPO_URL, REQUIREMENTS } from '../../config/site';
import { LATEST, downloadURL } from '../../config/releases';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 cell-grid opacity-70" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <!-- The window's own glow, bleeding off the top of the page. -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[32rem] w-[52rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full opacity-25 blur-3xl"
    style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #66ccff 0%, transparent 65%)"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pt-24 sm:px-6 pb-20 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-primary/80 uppercase">
      A workspace for getting things done
    </p>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
      Everything you're waiting on,<br />
      <span class="accent-text">one keystroke away.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
      More of the work is being done by something that isn't you — an agent, a
      pipeline, a training run, a reviewer. Onyx is a jet-black overlay that drops
      over whatever you're doing and shows the state of all of it at once: what's
      due today, which sessions are still producing output, which pull requests are
      blocked, which builds are red, and how the machines are holding up.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
      Underneath it, terminals that are already connected. Close the lid, change
      networks, walk away for a day — come back and start typing.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <a
        href={downloadURL(LATEST.version)}
        class="accent-glow rounded-lg bg-accent-primary px-6 py-3 font-medium text-bg-primary transition hover:bg-accent-glow"
      >
        Download for Mac
      </a>
      <a
        href={REPO_URL}
        class="rounded-lg border border-border-subtle px-6 py-3 font-medium text-text-secondary transition hover:border-border-hover hover:text-text-primary"
      >
        Source on GitHub
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs text-text-muted">
      v{LATEST.version} &middot; {REQUIREMENTS.os} &middot; {REQUIREMENTS.arch} &middot; free and open source
    </p>

    <!-- The thing itself: a terminal, with the overlay's status line under it. -->
    <div
      class="mt-16 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-secondary/80 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-b border-border-subtle px-4 py-3">
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-bad/60"></span>
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-warn/60"></span>
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-ok/60"></span>
        <span class="ml-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-muted">onyx — workstation — main</span>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-1.5 px-4 py-5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed sm:px-5 sm:py-6 sm:text-[13px]">
        <p class="text-text-muted">
          <span class="text-accent-primary">you@workstation</span>
          <span class="text-text-secondary">~/src/api</span>
          <span class="text-ok">main</span>
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">$ swift test</p>
        <p class="text-text-muted">Executed 854 tests, with 0 failures</p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
          $ <span class="inline-block h-4 w-2 translate-y-0.5 bg-accent-primary/80 [animation:blink_1.1s_step-end_infinite]"></span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-border-subtle px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] sm:px-5 sm:text-[11px] text-text-muted"
      >
        <span><span class="text-ok">●</span> connected</span>
        <span>CPU 12%</span>
        <span>MEM 34.2 GB</span>
        <span>GPU 61%</span>
        <span><span class="text-bad">4</span> today</span>
        <span><span class="text-warn">2</span> PRs</span>
        <span class="text-accent-primary">⌘1 api</span>
        <span>⌘2 trainer</span>
        <span>⌘3 logs</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes blink {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }
</style>
